{
  "_createdAt": "2026-06-22T11:41:56Z",
  "_id": "drafts.1c86b22a-9777-44c2-bdc6-6d88bbfcef39",
  "_rev": "AvyC4d6ng0Vv1OIiyhOodA",
  "_type": "post",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-08-05T07:34:47Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "bf34565f4bb3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "374836337565",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most transcription guides assume you're the host of the call, or that you'll have time afterwards to write up what was said. Neither assumption holds for executive recruiting calls or M&A discussions, where you need an accurate record and your full attention on the conversation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d2b3d2558840",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "92229413356d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The average executive spends "
        },
        {
          "_key": "61bbc837505d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "83595c47f0c9"
          ],
          "text": "19+ hours"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c7d26bc77262",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "in meetings, and getting a reliable record of what was decided is essential for follow-through. The method you choose matters because each one makes a different trade-off between note quality, setup effort, and how much manual work is left for you afterwards. This guide covers three ways to get a Zoom transcript, and which one fits your situation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "83595c47f0c9",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.flowtrace.co/collaboration-blog/state-of-meetings-report"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bd590985c5b7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5c416592250d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The challenge of transcribing when you are not the host"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7df2fc6f6001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9704cfdcf9a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "By default, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "5310fe01d3ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "45a06dc58bb7"
          ],
          "text": "only hosts and co-hosts"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3aab53430c3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "can start a cloud recording. Participants need explicit permission from the host, granted through a setting in the host's Zoom account."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "45a06dc58bb7",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&sysparm_article=KB0062627"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7f24da62276b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5d8dd36595f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Zoom's recording options also differ in what they produce: cloud recordings are saved to your Zoom account, while local recordings save a file to the host's computer. Either way, you still have to review the recording afterwards to get usable notes out of it."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2ca97b280f2f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eeb58a0474d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This creates a real gap. You need a reliable record of the conversation, but capturing it usually means splitting your attention between listening and writing things down."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c2203410fe71",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e958ac894794",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Method 1: Use Zoom live captions and the save captions trick"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bfe0328ad477",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d315185879af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Zoom's live transcription feature (also called automated captioning) transcribes speech to text during the meeting and displays it on screen in real time. This is different from Zoom AI Companion, which is available on all paid Zoom Workplace plans (Pro, Business, and Enterprise) and adds speaker labels, post-meeting summaries, and the ability to ask questions about the meeting afterward."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1b2c1ea0e469",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "87a1f3147234",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Live captions are the more accessible option because they are available on Zoom accounts at no extra cost, but the host must enable them in account settings before the call, and availability may depend on your organization's plan and configuration."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7c1e0859d842",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5dd88345c4c5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Important May 2026 update: According to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4ad012930aa4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "6d503d541174"
          ],
          "text": "Zoom's support documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bd0374277a3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", as of May 18, 2026, users can no longer save or download closed captions in certain configurations. Check your organization's Zoom version before relying on this method, as the save-captions workaround may no longer be available."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "6d503d541174",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&sysparm_article=KB0063899"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d938a24801fa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1277a12867d9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to save Zoom captions step by step"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "360dba5538d1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "69ec4e6cd055",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Enable captions during the meeting."
        },
        {
          "_key": "9ab110b87de8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Click \"Show Captions\" from the Zoom toolbar at the bottom of your screen."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5e9d02f3ca69",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c528cc46cb3b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Open the full transcript panel."
        },
        {
          "_key": "4efe7564014f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Click the caret (^) above the \"Hide Captions\" button and select \"View Full Transcript.\""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6cb7125d8f9c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6d57214ca6ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Save before the meeting ends."
        },
        {
          "_key": "e7c4e029b9eb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " At the bottom of the transcript panel, click \"Save Transcript.\" The file downloads as a text file to your local device."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7f10accd9fa0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "13ef34e991e0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Act before the meeting closes."
        },
        {
          "_key": "9487573d5838",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " If you miss this step, the transcript is not retrievable from Zoom's UI after the session ends."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "638e6310452d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "44bb09a6d149",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Zoom AI Companion adds a third layer on top of live transcripts, generating meeting summaries and flagging action items, but it requires the host's account to be on a paid Zoom plan, making it unavailable in many participant situations."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bf58fd06014d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f53f777d3096",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pros and cons of Zoom live captions"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9c12cd24b54d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bb6d8060ec88",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72b91cbbbdf5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1534a9f641a3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Built into Zoom at no extra cost"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d990fc476d2c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "77ee046a3f56",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No third-party software required"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2c34f52e0913",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d2e72070cc4c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No visible participant added to the meeting"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d84b15985cc5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c8ffb72a0c6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "60241880277c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "852f539cc3d9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Host must enable the feature before or during the call"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "33c30418a4e8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9180cde21669",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Requires manual action to save before the meeting closes"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "45f0d0e76246",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9f9c12da3f37",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The May 2026 caption-saving restriction may block this entirely"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "34ace47889ba",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b68b492e477b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Speaker attribution and post-meeting AI analysis are limited compared to purpose-built tools on standard plans"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dcc9f570ce58",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "743c0804145c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Method 2: Use system audio capture tools like Granola"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b00cb5a63d3a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a2e0f2dcbe28",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "System audio capture takes a different approach. Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes, so you can stay in the conversation and have a written record to work from afterwards. It's good practice to let the other participants know you're using Granola to transcribe the callation and help generate your notes afterwards."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b33ebb653eda",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9a271735820a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola is an AI notepad for people in back-to-back meetings. You jot rough notes during the call, and when the meeting ends, Granola enhances those notes using the transcript captured from your device audio. Or you can leave the notepad blank and get a structured summary automatically. Either way, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "95290a751bd0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "9090dca8a3b3"
          ],
          "text": "transcription happens in real time"
        },
        {
          "_key": "70bbfd76f4ec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and works across Zoom, Google Meet, Teams, Slack huddles, and any other platform where audio plays through your computer."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "9090dca8a3b3",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/transcription"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ee8aaeed1d1a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "751b7f8c3ae1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0936a4908eff",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "1d0b892f4a07"
          ],
          "text": "Zoom integration guide"
        },
        {
          "_key": "eb4a53cda42e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " walks through setup: Granola detects your Zoom meetings from your calendar and starts transcribing on your device, so your notes are ready when the call ends."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "1d0b892f4a07",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/blog/how-to-use-granola-with-zoom"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fa58efb4f6aa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d38368186f16",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How device audio capture works without a bot"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "02da73ded788",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aa0fe3b5fe4f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola accesses the same microphone and system audio output that your headphones or speakers use. It captures device audio and transcribes in real time. Audio is deleted once transcription is complete."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7d516987beb6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fc48600ee370",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4822432f8255",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "58a43d12e7df"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's security and privacy documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e1debe191ca0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "states: \"Once transcription is complete, the audio is deleted from our systems and any third-party services. We do not retain audio recordings.\" Only the transcript and your notes persist."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "58a43d12e7df",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/consent-security-privacy/security-privacy-data-faqs"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "841f0dea281c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dbcd4b1426ba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola "
        },
        {
          "_key": "92d3c576ccc6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "1f767aea71dd"
          ],
          "text": "achieved SOC 2 Type 2 certification"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b5d180cac618",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "in July 2025 and is GDPR compliant. Granola's security page also confirms that third-party AI providers are contractually prohibited from training on your data."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "1f767aea71dd",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "83bf20a15b5e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c09745b7ba62",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pros and cons of system audio capture"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f2b4910ecf84",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dc55646bb28c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "be378a1ad9d4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00afba5505f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d024affab54c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "861d01f6b947",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Works on your own machine, without changes to your Zoom account settings"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "32feafdd2c23",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c5739727ae08",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Audio is deleted after transcription (no stored recording)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bee33bf12399",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8b4e8c698a05",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 and GDPR compliant"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0954948f8d94",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e3b0d615c22d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Works with any meeting platform where audio plays through your computer"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "75c867a1ddd9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1854b13f32f6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Human-in-the-loop enhancement means your notes guide the AI output"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a85ea72fca14",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b027d2f696c4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Setup takes under 5 minutes"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "83ffba7e42d8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3dd3458c1bd0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f74e867edb27",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b86eb42a630a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No audio playback after the meeting (audio is deleted once transcription is complete)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e0a70672bd3b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7650aa22999b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Requires downloading a desktop or iPhone app"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e0f4c53c7164",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0e610b43a23c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Android support is planned but not yet available"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "09fcb7e03be5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5a801e7ae083",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"What I like best about Granola is how effortlessly it handles meeting notes without disrupting the flow of the conversation. It listens directly from my device audio no bots joining calls and produces clean, structured summaries with decisions, action items, and key points.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3726146c52aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5be72901cbcb"
          ],
          "text": "Brahmatheja Reddy M. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5be72901cbcb",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11932118"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3016a792c4cb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0ac9ec05eef3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Method 3: Use third-party bot tools"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "660b3b638af7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "58a23e2d1a3e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bot-based transcription tools work by joining your Zoom call as a separate participant. You connect them to your calendar, they receive the meeting invite, and they dial in when the call starts. From there, they transcribe the full conversation in real time. For teams that need audio playback for compliance or training, bot-based tools are purpose-built for that workflow."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "27ace3514bbb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0a238f103920",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pros and cons of bot-based transcription"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "654869b10a9c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1effb243114c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pros:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2c7c29a4d116",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4816f3e1a45b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Audio playback available for verification"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "db4fd2d83ffb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5c87bf74c8f8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Strong speaker attribution on group calls"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6603930d6024",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "20ee124f4188",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Deep CRM integrations and conversation analytics"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4d32717e2076",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9bf9045d9702",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Works across many meeting types without device-level setup"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6b9d76c83ce0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f8f40bd10e3f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cons:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "75564f23ae37",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c276de04903e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Joins as a visible participant and triggers recording notifications for all attendees"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "12088d31c0cf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6933398a5d82",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "121298ad0b3c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f09edb9ef6e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Requires the host to allow external participants in meeting settings"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c2ff8fd2f927",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5292c74e1c19",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e962c5870097",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "61a132b9348c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Comparing the 3 ways to transcribe Zoom meetings"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "24b226c72739",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table style=\"width:100%; table-layout:fixed; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n <thead>\n <tr>\n <th style=\"width:28%; padding:12px; text-align:left; white-space:normal;\">Method</th>\n <th style=\"width:32%; padding:12px; text-align:left; white-space:normal;\">Ease of use</th>\n <th style=\"width:40%; padding:12px; text-align:left; white-space:normal;\">Note quality</th>\n </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody>\n <tr>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">Zoom native captions</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">Moderate (host must enable, manual save)</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">Moderate (live captions only; no post-meeting summary on standard plans)</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">System audio capture (Granola)</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">High (under 5 min setup, auto-detects meetings)</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">High (notes enhanced from your own rough notes; works across meeting platforms)</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">Bot-based tools (Otter, Fireflies)</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">High (calendar integration, auto-joins)</td>\n <td style=\"padding:12px;\">Low (visible participant, announces itself)</td>\n </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "47ddc5e38394",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7d053e3ccfbb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Method 1 is free and built in, but depends on host enablement and the recent May 2026 caption-saving restriction may limit it further. Method 2 works regardless of host settings and turns your rough notes into a structured write-up, but requires downloading a separate app. Method 3 is the right fit when full automation and audio playback are the priority."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ea90096359af",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "98c00d71abc2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Letting participants know you're using an AI notetaker"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5348f093d0f2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7594eee544eb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "07a79d42888d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f4539371c5a0"
          ],
          "text": "in-meeting notice documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2939d1a639b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " covers how to tell participants you're taking AI notes. Let people know at the start of the meeting that you're using an AI assistant to take notes, and follow your organization's policy and any local consent requirements."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "f4539371c5a0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/consent-security-privacy/automatic-in-chat-entrance-messaging"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "97e9f4f1d76a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aa6c6e373e84",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola can send a customizable consent message at the start of each meeting on macOS. Enable this in Settings under 'Let others know you're using Granola'."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "65fe78af1579",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6ee1fd9e0975",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Which transcription method fits your scenario?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1b3756d7f53a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "748833c6ec63",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The right method depends less on features and more on what the meeting requires."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e31ab300ed69",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "930576cbe8f2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "For internal syncs and team standups:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6771edbab1ae",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Any of the three methods works well here. Bot-based tools provide the most automation with the least manual effort. Zoom native captions are a reasonable free option if the host consistently enables them."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b37c48de8785",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1368b0c3e4f3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "For sales calls with prospects:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f62aeab0a863",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " System audio capture gives sales teams a full transcript and structured notes to update the CRM afterward, so reps can stay focused on the prospect during the call. Tell prospects at the start that you're using an AI notetaker. The HubSpot integration on the Business plan pushes notes directly to their CRM with auto folder triggering, removing the manual step entirely."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "97f5d9f4cbf1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d4a3dad7fc0e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "For customer research interviews:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c43e5c726cd8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Product managers running customer interviews need to stay present enough to ask good follow-up questions. System audio capture handles documentation in the background so they can focus on the conversation. Product managers can then query across all research calls to find patterns using Granola Chat, asking \"What feature requests came up most often this quarter?\" and getting source-linked citations from every relevant session."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b206b6c30416",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "86a0ff0c1cd2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"With Granola I don't have to worry anymore about taking meeting notes, I can just write down things I really care about and let Granola take care of the rest.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3a1131db3d65",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "3d47c3c2b634"
          ],
          "text": "Jess M. on G2"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "3d47c3c2b634",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-9856422"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c39c139400e3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "85c774695a15",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Try system audio capture in your next meeting. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c037a54d79f2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5deb11cb7174"
          ],
          "text": "Download"
        },
        {
          "_key": "01beb7d36395",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Granola for free, connect your Google or Microsoft calendar, and have your first transcript ready in under 5 minutes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5deb11cb7174",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0d9c18c2d42a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "87e01d129291",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQs"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "314de4d84ab8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "67c242ec7387",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can a Zoom participant get a transcript without the host's help?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "faf96d3a3a1a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2056ddc811bf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. Granola works at the device level rather than through Zoom's internal recording system, so it doesn't depend on your Zoom account settings. Let the other participants know you're using an AI notetaker at the start of the call. Zoom's native captions and save-transcript features require the host to enable the live transcription setting first."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "06c6bf6eb424",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5baf891459e9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola show up in the Zoom participant list?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3562f106f7fc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "12e6cf9d9557",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No. Granola captures "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f9adf13e4383",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "0d4568f9234f"
          ],
          "text": "device audio locally"
        },
        {
          "_key": "01a95ac382f2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " rather than joining via a calendar invite or Zoom link, so it doesn't appear as a participant in the meeting. On macOS, Granola can send a customizable message at the start of the call so participants know you're using an AI notetaker."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "0d4568f9234f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/transcription"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f7e598e8459c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dfd56266eccd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What happens to the audio after Granola transcribes a Zoom call?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b1fb741d10f1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ca4ba5e9f9d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola deletes the audio after transcription is complete. Per "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2e62b8bd382b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "879e46800a2d"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's security documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "286e72509d3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", only the transcript and your notes persist, and third-party providers are contractually prohibited from training on your data."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "879e46800a2d",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/consent-security-privacy/security-privacy-data-faqs"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2fd6dba30710",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e2a80e8ec00e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Is Zoom's save captions feature still available in 2026?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5c80203e9aee",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c000b52bde5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As of May 18, 2026, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2d4f44cec01b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "35c938d1d04c"
          ],
          "text": "Zoom restricted caption saving"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4e8969abca55",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in certain account configurations. Check your organization's Zoom settings before relying on this method, as availability depends on your plan and region."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "35c938d1d04c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://uis.jhu.edu/zoom/zoom-live-transcription/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3194a3b2e304",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b3a684f2c11f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Glossary"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3a68abec8c56",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "03760d85ba11",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Bot-based transcription:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "af4cff37933c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " An approach used by tools like Otter and Fireflies, where the transcription service joins a Zoom meeting as a visible participant using a calendar invite. This produces audio playback and detailed analytics but announces itself to all meeting participants upon joining."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bd90584f30db",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ea66434e1d90",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b1e0b42f654f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A security certification that requires an independent audit of a company's data security controls over a sustained period. Granola achieved SOC 2 Type 2 certification in July 2025, covering how Granola handles meeting transcripts and user data."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
